    "text": "In the circuit shown in figure potential difference between points $A$ and $B$ is $16 \\mathrm{~V}$. the current passing through $2 \\Omega$ resistance will be\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/UZbUESIx80GM6K0l50vBIuvRhaCpq4e_7uhL3_sImFs.original.fullsize.png\">",
